 <h3><u>Baba baba kehte</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>SO GAYEE SAKINA<br> SO GAYEE SAKINA<br> KAISE RABABE KHASTA JIGAR SE KAHE KOI<br> DUNIYA ME AB TUMHARI SAKINA NAHI RAHI<br> ASHQON SE APNE BABA KE RUKSAAR DHO GAYEE<br> AAGOSH ME HUSSAIN KA SAR RAKH KE SO GAYEE<br> BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>ZINDA ME KAISE ALLAH JAANE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA ..(2)</p> 
  <p>AHLE HARAM ME SHORE BUQA HAI KAISI QAYAMAT AAYI<br> GURBAT ME PHIR APNI BAHEN KO ROTA HAI EK BHAI<br> APNA HI NAUHA PADHTE PADHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>GOADI ME RAKHKAR SARVAR KE SAR KO RORO KE DUKHDA SUNAYA<br> KHAAYE HAI KITNE PATTHAR BATAKAR KURTE KA DAAMAN DIKHAYA<br> BABA KE MOO PE MOO RAKHE RAKHE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>DIL KO YAQEE THA ZINDA SE EK DIN MIL JAYEGI REHAAI<br> KOI KABHI TO AAYEGA LENE KAB TAK RAHEGI JUDAAI<br> ZINDA KE DAR PE BAITHE BAITHE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>GHASSAALA YE DEKH KE&nbsp; ROYEE KAISE BHALA NAHLAE<br> KAISE BADAN SE KURTA UTAARE KAISE BHALA KAFNAE<br> ZAKHMO KI CHADAR ODHE ODHE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>QAIDE SITAM ME PYARI BAHEN KI KIS DIL SE TURBAT BANAYEE<br> HAATHON SE APNE NA JAANE KAISE NANHI SEE MAYYAT UTHAAYEE<br> KAISE KIYA TURBAT KE HAVAALE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>ROTA RAHA EK BHAI BAHEN KI MAYYAT PAR ZINDA ME<br> KAHTA RAHA MAAJAEE LAGEGA TUJHKO DAR ZINDA ME<br> TUJHKO KAHA NEEND AATI THI KAISE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>KAISE RABABE KHASTA JIGAR KO&nbsp; SAMJHAEGI ZAINAB<br> BETI KA CHEHRA MAA KO&nbsp; KAISE DIKHLAEGI ZAINAB<br> KAISE KAHEGI ROTE ROTE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>KAISE JAGAYE KAISE UTHAYE KAISE LAGAYE DIL SE<br> AAKHIR YE SADMA KOI BATAYE KAISE UTHAYE DIL SE<br> BEEMAR KHUD KO KAISE SAMBHAALE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>ASIF AAMIR KAISE SUNAAYE MAZLOOMA KA NAUHA<br> AHLE HARAM KO KIS TARHA DE MASOOMA KA PURSA<br> ZULME SITAMGAR SAHTE SAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
  <p>BABA BABA KAHTE KAHTE SO GAYEE SAKINA..(2)</p> 
  <p>SO GAYEE SAKINA<br> SO GAYEE SAKINA</p> 
